Subject: [PATCH 4/5] fix(tools): check insert and seat specs and normalize
 connections in a component

ToolComponent::new now runs InsertSpec::check and InsertSeatSpec::check
on the specs it is given, and names the component, the seat port and
the position in each refusal. check_insert_fit runs the same checks as
a guard. InsertSpec::check also confirms that the value is the parse of
its own text. ConnectionCode::canonical gives the value that the code's
text parses to; the component stores it, and takes compares canonical
forms, so a non-canonical typed code fits its canonical twin.

